Third-party work
================

Some files are ports of other GPL projects. Their authors keep their
copyright. The ports are under GPL-3.0-or-later as part of this program.

src/jelly-drag.ts, src/effect/jelly-drag.frag
  A port of KWin's wobblywindows effect
  (https://invent.kde.org/plasma/kwin, src/plugins/wobblywindows).
  Copyright (C) 2008 Cédric Borgese. License: GPL-2.0-or-later.

src/magic-lamp.ts, src/effect/magic-lamp.frag
  A port of KWin's magiclamp effect
  (https://invent.kde.org/plasma/kwin, src/plugins/magiclamp).
  Copyright (C) 2008 Martin Gräßlin. License: GPL-2.0-or-later.

src/sliding-popups.ts
  A port of KWin's slidingpopups effect
  (https://invent.kde.org/plasma/kwin, src/plugins/slidingpopups).
  Copyright (C) 2009 Marco Martin, 2018 Vlad Zahorodnii.
  License: GPL-2.0-or-later.

src/coverflow.tsx, src/switcher-label.ts, src/helpers/switcher-label.py
  A port of the GNOME Shell extension "Coverflow Alt-Tab"
  (https://github.com/dsheeler/CoverflowAltTab, src/coverflowSwitcher.js).
  Copyright (C) its authors. License: GPL-3.0.

The rest started from ShojiWM's default config
(https://github.com/bea4dev/ShojiWM, packages/config):

